<title>INDIA: India's yr/yr inflation falls to 6.51 pct in week.</title>
<headline>India's yr/yr inflation falls to 6.51 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 6.51 percent in the week ended October 19 from 6.65 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES	Oct 19	  Oct 12     Oct 21, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +6.51	   +6.65	  +8.21</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  317.4	   317.5	  298.0</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended October 21, 1995.</p>
</text>
